  "bodyTemplate": "FACILITY REQUEST\nSecurity Update — requests office space setup, repairs, or facility changes.\nRequested By: {{subject_name}}          Date: {{date}}\nDepartment: {{department}}              Location / Room: {{location}}\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n{{details}}\n--------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nApprover: {{approver_name}}\n\nSignature: {{signature}}"
